## Pull requests

GitHub blocks direct pushes to `main`. Work on a bookmark and merge through a
PR.

1. Create a bookmark on your work: `jj bookmark create <name> -r @`.
2. Push it: `jj git push --bookmark <name>`.
3. Open a PR. The `check`, `test-db`, and `test-visual` jobs must pass.
   Squash-merge only.
4. Sync after merge: `jj git fetch`.
